   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Walk-on**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **Tezeta**: rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **Down the Sink**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Cyboogie**: rare: 11 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2019-09-02.ca14.flac1648** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 94 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recorded from the top balcony, right of center, facing a sold-out, sweaty crowd [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2019-09-02.ca14.flac1648**: source: Church Audio CA-14 cardiods > ugly battery box > Roland R-05 [24-48k] [1]. Also: Recorded using Church Audio CA-14 cardioids clipped to glasses into a Roland R-05 recorder; Processed in Sound Forge to boost levels and remove frequencies below 20 Hz without EQ [1]",
